        "text": "No new release was started: [{{steps.open_already.title}}]({{steps.open_already.url}}) is still open, and the release workflow opens only one release PR at a time. It merges by itself once its checks pass (that release ships); if they failed, push a fix to the release branch or close it. Then run Cut a release again.",
        "title": "Release PR #{{steps.open_already.number}} is still open"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 650.0,
        "y": 200.0
      }
    },
